    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview:</strong><br><br>Tap to stack the square bird higher. Don\u2019t bump into the ledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your bird stacking well, to survive longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The platforms will magically change, so you should too!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437210/extras/d9e75d231a5a0a1869ad085c9ba8f3c8.poster.avif?t=1741246940\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437210/extras/d9e75d231a5a0a1869ad085c9ba8f3c8.webm?t=1741246940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437210/extras/d9e75d231a5a0a1869ad085c9ba8f3c8.mp4?t=1741246940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless gameplay<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437210/extras/8730a26466b9b81a7375db8d9eac3074.avif?t=1741246940\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn coins to unlock new skins such as parrot, unicorn, rabbit, dog, wolf and more<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437210/extras/7f0bd66bcaaafef697eaf851c43703b6.avif?t=1741246940\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging gameplay<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437210/extras/ece10e65ff862ed6390f9f0f82de29be.avif?t=1741246940\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul>",
